{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791436620, "covers_from": "2026-10-08T05:17:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-08T05:18:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791436680, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:17:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 23190, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北的電動公車，不知道是司機沒有習慣車子的性能，還是車子設計有問題，起步或煞車都非常不順，很不舒服", "display_name": "中山代表 張友耀（阿默）", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:17:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29794, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "文化", "content": "台北市一些日據時代或民國初期留下的建築，要如何活化運用，打造台北散策！", "display_name": "中山代表 Pain MD_林煒_Peter", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:17:26+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 55808, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "中南社宅需要ubike車站", "display_name": "南港代表 No.55,808", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:17:31+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50727, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我是台北市民，我要說建國高架橋下的月租停車位，是否已經變成世襲制了，排隊候補2年都排不上呢", "display_name": "中山代表 No.50,727", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:17:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 33018, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我是開車族，道路不平很痛苦。建議將道路依照使用率分級，給予適當的養護週期，照表操課養護，維持路平", "display_name": "文山代表 Jin-Jang Guo", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 29794, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 Pain MD_林煒_Peter", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 55808, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "南港代表 No.55,8